TTYCHATTER.BASH(1)         User Commands         TTYCHATTER.BASH(1)

NAME
    ttychatter.bash - dependency-light Bash-only OpenRouter chat client

SYNOPSIS
    ttychatter.bash [session]
    ttychatter.bash --demo [session]
    ttychatter.bash --models
    ttychatter.bash --routers
    ttychatter.bash --test-model MODEL
    ttychatter.bash --set-api-key
    ttychatter.bash --forget-api-key
    ttychatter.bash --doctor
    ttychatter.bash --version
    ttychatter.bash --help

DESCRIPTION
    ttychatter.bash is the Bash-only implementation. It avoids Python and keeps
    dependencies light while still providing sessions, model tools, attachments,
    loopback, GPG-aware API-key storage, and local colon commands.

RUNTIME COMMANDS
    Colon commands typed at the chat prompt are handled locally and are not sent
    to the AI model:

        :help
        :models
        :routers
        :select-model
        :test-model MODEL
        :config
        :set KEY VALUE
        :unset KEY
        :set-api-key
        :forget-api-key
        :memory
        :attach FILE
        :editor
        :credits
        :doctor
        :quit

API KEY STORAGE
    --set-api-key presents storage choices:

        runtime only
        encrypted with gpg
        plaintext config

    If gpg is unavailable, the command says "gpg not found" and keeps the key
    runtime-only when encrypted storage is requested. Plaintext storage requires
    explicit confirmation.

CONFIGURATION
    Default config file:
        ~/.config/ttychatter/openrouter/config

    Relevant keys:
        OPENROUTER_API_KEY
        API_KEY_GPG_FILE
        THEME
        SEND_INPUT
        MODEL
        MODEL_TYPE_FILTER
        CONTEXT_TURNS
        SESSION_DIR
        ATTACHMENT_DIR
        MODEL_CACHE_FILE
        CODE_ATTACHMENT_MIN_LINES

VERSION
    ttychatter.bash version 0.13.0-bash-only
